        "description": "USN-7855-1 fixed vulnerabilities in Unbound. It was discovered that the fix for CVE-2025-11411 was incomplete. This update fixes the problem.  Original advisory details:   Yuxiao Wu, Yunyi Zhang, Baojun Liu, and Haixin Duan discovered that  Unbound incorrectly handled certain promiscuous NS RRSets. A remote  attacker could possibly use this issue to perform a domain hijack attack.",
